        <mxCell id="oxo41suUsddXivOelkM4-55" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="VARCHAR&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;VARCHAR&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;VARCHAR&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="100" x="660" y="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FS0cegBVJ3XO-Al01MWg-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Una sola PK per tabella: Product -- Product Id, Region -- RegionID, Sales -- SalesID;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Ogni FK referenzia una PK esistente: Sales. ProductID -- Product.ProductID, Sales.RegionID -- Region.Region ID;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Cardinalità N:1 rispettata: m&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;olte righe di Sales possono avere lo stesso ProductID -- lato N in Sales, lato 1 in Product;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;molte righe di Sales possono avere lo stesso RegionID -- lato N in Sales, lato 1 in Region;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Minimizzazione della ridondanza: n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;essun dato di Product o Region è duplicato dentro Sales: la tabella dei fatti contiene solo gli ID (le FK), non i nomi o le categorie.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="205" width="760" x="20" y="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="FS0cegBVJ3XO-Al01MWg-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Task 1b, Progettazione Logica&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
